et.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c002c74ab8e3928a\" href=\"?note=c002c74ab8e3928a\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-open predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b683d32b4fafc184\" href=\"?note=b683d32b4fafc184\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-forcing11-dense-open-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S\\)</span> (dense-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c002c74ab8e3928a\" href=\"?note=c002c74ab8e3928a\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DistributiveForcingProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DistributiveForcingProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DistributiveForcingProperty}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall F\\;\\Bigl((F:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(F(\\alpha),P,\\leq_P))\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S(\\{p\\in P:\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\in F(\\alpha))\\},P,\\leq_P)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12DistributiveForcingProperty}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall F\\;\\Bigl((F:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal P(P)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11DenseOpenSet}_S(F(\\alpha),P,\\leq_P))\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingDenseSet}_S(\\{p\\in P:\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\in F(\\alpha))\\},P,\\leq_P)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dense-open inputs and the dense intersection now use their canonical predicates; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DenseOpenIn}\">\\(\\operatorname{DenseOpenIn}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DenseIn}\">\\(\\operatorname{DenseIn}\\)</span> had no definitions.</li>\n<li>The intersection is written as a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>, so the empty family yields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> rather than an undefined or proper-class-valued empty intersection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[